@startuml
!include ../../common/eztrade-style.puml

title EZTrade Operations - Branching and Release Evidence

actor "Developer" as Developer
component "Git branch main" as Main EZ_DEVOPS
component "GitHub Actions\npush to main" as PushCi EZ_DEVOPS
component "GitHub Actions\npull_request to main" as PrCi EZ_DEVOPS
component "Backend Maven verify" as Verify EZ_BACKEND
component "Local Docker Compose\nmanual runtime" as LocalCompose EZ_DEVOPS
component "Deployment/release job\nnot found" as DeployMissing EZ_RISK
component "Versioned release strategy\nnot documented in repo" as ReleaseMissing EZ_RISK

Developer --> Main : push
Developer --> PrCi : opens PR to main
Developer --> LocalCompose : docker compose up --build
Main --> PushCi
PushCi --> Verify
PrCi --> Verify
Verify ..> DeployMissing : no later deployment step
Verify ..> ReleaseMissing : no declared release artifact flow
LocalCompose ..> DeployMissing : local only, not production release

note bottom
Evidence: ../.github/workflows/maven.yml and docker-compose.yml.
Only triggers on main can be inferred. There are no staging/prod environments,
tag-based release flow, or branch policy document.
end note

@enduml
